The Conflict Check Agent safeguards neutrality by verifying that the proposed mediator, arbitrator, or professional has no conflicts of interest with the parties involved. It runs automated background checks across professional databases, past assignments, and corporate relationships to detect any prior engagements, affiliations, or adverse interests.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761648311;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761648311;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:74:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:mediator_constitution:conflict_check_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:1027;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}